decisions.decision:
IVA: `agent_fiscal_profiles.vat_rate_id` nullable (null = operazione senza IVA, es. forfettario).
      Formule (bcmath scala 2, half-up, arrotondamento per voce):
      accruals_amount = somma movimenti ACCRUAL/REVERSAL inclusi; adjustments_amount = somma ADJUSTMENT inclusi;
      taxable_amount = accruals_amount + adjustments_amount;
      vat_amount = taxable x vat_rate/100 (0 senza aliquota);
      withholding_amount = taxable x base_percent/100 x rate/100 (0 se ritenuta disattiva);
      enasarco: vedi D-3; net_payable = taxable + vat - withholding - enasarco_agent_amount.
      enasarco_principal_amount e' solo informativo (costo del preponente).

in.item:
Migrazioni: enasarco_parameters; commission_settlement_runs; commission_settlements;
        commission_settlement_number_sequences; alter commission_accruals (+company_id con backfill,
        +commission_settlement_id, +notes, +created_by, recipient_role nullable); alter agent_fiscal_profiles (+vat_rate_id).

spec.data_model:
enasarco_parameters: id; year unsignedSmallInteger unique; total_rate decimal(5,2); agent_share_percent decimal(5,2);
  single_firm_ceiling decimal(15,2); multi_firm_ceiling decimal(15,2); notes text nullable; timestamps. LogsModelActivity.
agent_fiscal_profiles: + vat_rate_id FK vat_rates nullable restrictOnDelete.
commission_accruals: + company_id FK companies nullable restrictOnDelete (backfill da invoices; null solo su
  movimenti orfani); + commission_settlement_id FK commission_settlements nullable restrictOnDelete (emendato in build, review security L-2: un estratto non si cancella mai senza rilasciare prima i movimenti); + notes string(500)
  nullable; + created_by FK users nullable nullOnDelete; recipient_role nullable; indice
  (recipient_type, recipient_id, company_id, commission_settlement_id).
commission_settlement_runs: id; period_from date; period_to date; filters json (company_id, referent_ids,
  recipient_roles); min_amount decimal(15,2); settlements_count unsignedInteger; skipped json
  [{referent_id, company_id, reason}]; created_by FK users restrict; timestamps; index period_to.
commission_settlements: id; commission_settlement_run_id FK nullable nullOnDelete; company_id FK restrict;
  referent_id FK restrict; agent_fiscal_profile_id FK restrict; status string(16) index; number unsignedInteger
  nullable; year unsignedSmallInteger nullable; unique(company_id, year, number); period_from, period_to date;
  accruals_amount, adjustments_amount, taxable_amount decimal(15,2); vat_rate decimal(5,2) nullable; vat_amount;
  withholding_enabled bool; withholding_rate, withholding_base_percent decimal(5,2) nullable; withholding_amount;
  enasarco_enabled bool; enasarco_mandate_type string(16) nullable; enasarco_base_amount, enasarco_agent_amount,
  enasarco_principal_amount, net_payable decimal(15,2); notes text nullable; issued_at timestamp nullable;
  issued_by FK users nullable; cancelled_at timestamp nullable; cancelled_by FK users nullable;
  cancellation_reason string(500) nullable; created_by FK users restrict; timestamps.
  Indici (referent_id, company_id, status), (status, period_to). LogsModelActivity.
commission_settlement_number_sequences: id; company_id FK cascade; year; last_number; unique(company_id, year).

endpoint.request:
{ period_from: date, period_to: date >= period_from, company_id: int|null (exists),
        referent_ids: int[]|null (exists referents), recipient_roles: ("COMMERCIAL"|"REPORTER"|"SUPERVISOR")[]|null,
        min_amount: decimal >= 0 | null }

acceptance_criteria.criterion:
Emetti: assegna numero progressivo per (company, anno di period_to) partendo da 1, issued_at/by;
      due societa' hanno sequenze indipendenti; un numero non viene riusato dopo un annullo; DRAFT con taxable <= 0
      dopo il ricalcolo -> 409; dopo l'emissione PATCH/recalculate/delete -> 409.
